Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Previously on JoJo's Bizarre Adventure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um-ta-da-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sly bastard, Avdol, is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.32,0:00:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.23,0:00:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and Jotaro were the\Nones who tended to the wounds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on my head back in India after\NI was shot by Hull Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I also had Avdol do some shopping\Nfor me while he was laying low.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From here on out, we're\Nriding to Egypt in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.19,0:00:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you afford this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister Dust
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.57,0:01:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.57,0:02:17.54,Title 3,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,480)\pos(197,810)\fscx86}Episode 23: The High Priestess, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The terrain has changed\Nfor Jotaro and company,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who've entered what\Ndivers across the globe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,call the most beautiful sea in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flanked on the east and west by desert,
