Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible! It's a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but it\Nmanaged to sneak aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It disappeared! No, it didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It transformed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand disguised itself as one of the\Ngauges, just like with the coffee cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come again? Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The coral reef is right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we were only a few hundred\Nmeters from reaching Egypt!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the bright side, it looks like Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar was only knocked unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who'd be calling us at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ignore it, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.90,0:12:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to stay focused!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the High Priestess!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.53,0:12:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our enemy's using a deadly\Nstand called the High Priestess!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how do we win?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By knowing the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of this particular\Nstand user is Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has the ability to control\Nher stand from far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so she's most likely on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's its power?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can turn into almost any inanimate\Nobject, as long as it comes from a mineral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.34,0:12:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plastics, metal, glass, or vinyl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its transformations are perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way to recognize the\Nthing until it decides to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how did it sneak aboard the\Nsubmarine in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now, so that's how it did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:12:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It cut a hole and moseyed on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand found a way to\Ndamage the ballast tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sinking even faster now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention, we're losing oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's ever calling us horrible timing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, remember anything we\Ntouched might be the...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi again, Joseph. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We weren't finished with the\Nconversation we were having earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I made Roses give me your number.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And come to think of it, what's\Nwith all the ruckus over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever's in the background\Nsounds like a siren.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also hear running water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is a bathtub overflowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but the old man\Ncan't come to the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that voice. Is that you? Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Joseph?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you with your grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.54,0:13:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry\Nabout, Grandma Suzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be just fine,\Nbecause I'm right here with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.57,0:14:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll call back once\Nthings calm down. Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.14,0:14:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're about to hit the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew this would happen to us somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.30,0:14:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like every vehicle we ride\Nin ends up getting destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the last straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never riding in a submarine again.
