Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was getting through a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now it seems as though\Nthe line's suddenly gone dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why was Jotaro there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, the air is\Ngetting pretty thin in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you catch which one of the\Ngauges the stand merged with?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, from what I can tell, it\Nlooked like it turned into this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.74,0:16:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, it's already moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right behind Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hierophant Green!
