Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, head for the door, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.02,0:16:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand's become part of the whole surface\Nand is traveling through the machines!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you say that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we stay in this room any longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a very good chance that none\Nof us will leave with our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.58,0:16:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone, to the next room!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll seal the room\Noff and trap it inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:17:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way it already moved to the\Ndoor and transformed itself into the wheels
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to let go before it's too late\Nits claws were able to slice through mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.02,0:17:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar's prosthetic\Nhand like it was nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.16,0:17:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.90,0:17:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah we got
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It that was, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, our little friend here\Nisn't as fast as Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.08,0:17:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what should we do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy, Jotaro. Don't hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we begin by\Nripping off his little head?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.60,0:17:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard.
