Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna beat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.22,0:17:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's strong! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.74,0:17:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it outsmarted Johtaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.62,0:18:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.53,0:18:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever's happening here, I'm\Npretty sure that we're in a pinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.42,0:18:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That beast will attack us if we touch it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means we should\Nuse our stands instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.56,0:18:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magicians, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.34,0:18:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hilda Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Stan's a tough one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.28,0:18:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chariot's rapier can't pierce its armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, pick up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.64,0:18:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to attack before it gets away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need all of you to stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still some oxygen over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.56,0:18:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's going to run out before long!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.89,0:18:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.86,0:18:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll only transform again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're taking on water fast, so we\Nneed to find a way to trap that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll figure out how to fight it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get too cocky because\Nthis battle isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your ass soon enough.
