Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, why in the hell would you\Nanswer a phone call from Susie? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you really\Nshouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll talk about it when\Nwe get out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.26,0:19:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.48,0:19:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.39,0:19:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a plan? You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.60,0:19:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's a brilliant one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.68,0:19:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one and only Joseph Joestar\Nhas been in more situations like
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this that he can count on the\Nprosthetic hand he left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the life of me, I can't begin to\Nunderstand why Jotaro is with Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:19:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has Joseph said anything? No, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.94,0:20:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, my heart jumped with joy to\Nhear that boy's voice after so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard my precious little grandson\Nhas been quite the handful as of late?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But deep down, he's a sweet child\Nwho cares very much for his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever they're doing, I'm sure he's\Nhelping Joseph as much as he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how right you are, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Jotaro and Master\NJoseph are most likely in
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the midst of battling a\Ncommon enemy as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're fighting tooth and\Nnail to save Miss Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone very dear to them,\Nfrom a curse of unbridled evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.70,0:20:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling that she-devil of a stand
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.28,0:20:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't really the one who's\Nactually trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.78,0:20:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:21:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that monster's going to cut its way\Nout of that room and catch up to us.
