Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to make matters even worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as we're surrounded by all\Nthis machinery, we're sitting ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The submarine is done for anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.98,0:21:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to abandon ship and escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.36,0:21:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to find some\Nother way to make it to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.76,0:21:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you forgetting that we're\N40 meters below sea level?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it doesn't sound that far down, but\Nhow are we supposed to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we really scuba\Ndiving all the way there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my entire life, I've never\Ndone anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suit up on the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.50,0:21:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, good grief. Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just realized there's\Nno way I'll be able
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to suit up in time with this busted hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you help me out, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.98,0:21:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,god...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.27,0:22:14.69,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.69,0:22:16.95,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.60,0:22:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.95,0:22:18.41,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.84,0:22:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.20,0:22:21.66,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the birds are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.66,0:22:23.99,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the money on a bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.99,0:22:26.33,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.33,0:22:27.79,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.60,0:22:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.54,0:22:30.96,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.56,0:22:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with a hookah. I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.96,0:22:33.17,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.70,0:22:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.26,0:22:42.72,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.46,0:22:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.11,0:22:56.57,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:22:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.57,0:22:58.95,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:23:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.95,0:23:00.20,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.08,0:23:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop, you drink.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.24,0:23:03.58,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they bring you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.58,0:23:05.91,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.91,0:23:08.25,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.08,0:23:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings, oh, hey-oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.25,0:23:09.71,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.54,0:23:12.88,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.72,0:23:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.88,0:23:15.09,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.22,0:23:25.31,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
