Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must never panic, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.02,0:23:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at how\Nbeautiful it is down here.
